<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Privacy - ProToolNest</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for ProToolNest. How we collect and use your data.">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>

  <link rel="canonical" href="https://protoolnest.com/privacy"></head>
<body class="bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 bg-white my-8 rounded-xl border">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: November 16, 2026</p>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 text-sm">
      <p>ProToolNest collects only the information necessary to provide the service.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Email address and password (for account)</li>
        <li>Payment information (processed by Stripe, we do not store full card details)</li>
        <li>Usage data (which tools you use)</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">How We Use It</h2>
      <p>To provide access to tools, process payments, send important account emails (subscription status, expiry reminders), and improve the service.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your data. We share information only with service providers (Stripe for payments) as needed to operate the site.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may request deletion of your account and data by contacting support@protoolnest.com.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/" class="inline-block mt-8 text-indigo-600">← Back to Home</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
